  "details": "This is a minor bug with an easy fix from the user but should still be noted as a vrchat bug.\n\nAfter having baked your light probes in unity if you mark the gameobject with the light probe group on it or delete it players will no longer be affected by light probes. Dynamic game objects placed in the world will still receive lighting from light probes. To fix you just need to have any light probe group in your scene not marked EditorOnly.\n\nIn the gif you can see me using a lighting debug avatar in a world where the light probe object was tagged editor only.",
